# Vendored Hugo reference material. These are upstream snapshots, not
# our code — 169 MB that would sit in history forever. Re-clone them
# with the commands in docs/README.md. Ignoring them also protects them
# from `git clean -fd`, which skips ignored files.
docs/example-projects/
docs/hugo-docs-source/
